{"id":"efecto","lemma":"efecto","pos":"noun","rank":1177,"glosses":["effect"],"ipa":"/eˈfeɡto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"efectos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/31/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-efecto.wav","examples":[{"text":"El efecto fue inmediato.","en":"The effect was immediate."},{"text":"Los efectos son irreversibles.","en":"The effects are not reversible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645631"},{"text":"La estrategia de Tom surtió efecto.","en":"Tom's strategy paid off."},{"text":"Los efectos son reversibles.","en":"The effects are reversible."},{"text":"El remedio tuvo un efecto inmediato.","en":"The medicine had an immediate effect."}]}